BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Eight Step Recovery Group For Men
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260423T170000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260423T183000
UID:ba5c311c4029e2643aec9b24@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:Eight Step Recovery is an alternative recovery program to the 
 12-Step program of Alcoholic Anonymous. The program is a set of mindfulnes
 s teachings outlining a suggested course of action for recovery from addic
 tion\, stinking thinking\, negative mental states\, and compulsive and obs
 essive behaviours.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/eight-step-recovery-for-
 men-23-apr
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Maitreyabandhu & Suvajra on the Meaning of Commitment
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260423T191500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260423T213000
UID:5363835eb20737d5ef7ddbb6@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:What does it mean to be a disciple in the Buddhist tradition? 
 Suvajra ordained Maitreyabandhu into the Triratna Buddhist Order\, and the
 ir long-standing teacher–student relationship brings inspiring insights 
 into how spiritual friendship can be. Maitreyabandhu will interview Suvajr
 a on what discipleship has meant in his own experience - how guidance\, tr
 ust\, and spiritual friendship shape a life of practice.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/discipleship-in-buddhism
END:VEVENT
